>> list := Mndandanda chatsopano.
list ~ ['hello'].
Zotuluka lembani: list chiwerengero-cha-zinthu.
list onjeza-kumapeto: ['world'].
Zotuluka lembani: list chiwerengero-cha-zinthu.
Zotuluka lembani: list tenga-chomaliza, lembani: list chiwerengero-cha-zinthu.
list onjeza-kumapeto: ['there'].
Zotuluka lembani: list chiwerengero-cha-zinthu.
Zotuluka lembani: (list malo: 0), lembani: (list malo: 1).
list ikani: ['xmas'] pa: 1.
list ikani: ['merry'] pa: 0.
Zotuluka lembani: list chiwerengero-cha-zinthu.
Zotuluka lembani: (list malo: 0), lembani: (list malo: 1).
